ations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":306,"digest":"sha256:ddbbd907f7cfd6a82b5ff7f3a45cfe2eb73aa9943e7d781ce66f7a525864934b","download_count":226,"created_at":"2026-11-10T13:37:21Z","updated_at":"2026-11-10T13:37:21Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/goharbor/harbor/releases/download/v2.16.0/md5sum"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goharbor/harbor/tarball/v2.16.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goharbor/harbor/zipball/v2.16.0","body":"<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at v2.16.0 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n### Exciting New Features 🎉\n* Update artifact_accessory to add source column to identify accessory by @stonezdj in https://github.com/goharbor/harbor/pull/23144\n* feat: replace redis with valkey as cache backend by @chlins in https://github.com/goharbor/harbor/pull/23157\n* Full Multi-Architecture Enablement for Harbor (amd64 + arm64) by @ranimandepudi in https://github.com/goharbor/harbor/pull/22311\n* Add ListReferrers API to registry client and update parseScopes by @stonezdj in https://github.com/goharbor/harbor/pull/23170\n* Proxy the referrer API to upstream registry with paging and local merge by @stonezdj in https://github.com/goharbor/harbor/pull/23237\n* feat(ui): support advanced proxy cache configurations in UI by @stonezdj in https://github.com/goharbor/harbor/pull/23536\n* feat(backend): implement proxy cache repository filter API by @stonezdj in https://github.com/goharbor/harbor/pull/23527\n* Custom project roles — frontend UI by @maxgraustenzel-create in https://github.c